# Local environment overrides. ".env.example" is the tracked schema; ".env"
# holds machine-specific values (dev server port, endpoint fallback) and must
# never be committed — a production IP baked into a tracked .env is exactly the
# hardcoding the multi-instance model removes.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
